          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A call host carries the call. Everyone in a call connects to it, and it passes the audio on, so it can hear the call. That is separate from chat hosting: a chat host is not a call host unless you also appoint it as one. Call hosts are members you trust, and each one chooses to accept. Appoint one from a member’s menu, or host calls on this phone. A phone only hosts calls that its owner starts."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "group_callhosts_note_base": {
      "comment": "Explanation under the call host list.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A call host carries the call. Everyone in a call connects to it, and it passes the audio on, so it can hear the call. That is separate from chat hosting: a chat host is not a call host unless you also appoint it as one. Call hosts are members you trust, and each one chooses to accept."
          }
        }
      }
    },
